                    <characteristic name="Rules" typeId="6b2a8df2-cb0b-5493-974f-d27207ce83fd">This unit or model rolls 1d6+Ld, and target enemy unit rolls 1d6+Ld. For each point higher this unit or model scored, the target suffers an Autowound with no Cover Saves.</characteristic>
